m3x6 Mono is a monospace remix of m3x6 by Daniel Linssen (managore),
https://managore.itch.io/m3x6

m3x6 is released by its author under Creative Commons CC0 1.0 Universal (public domain dedication): https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode

The remix is generated by nib.ref from the original glyph bitmaps; every
changed glyph is listed with its rule in m3x6-mono-exceptions.txt in the nib
repository.
